1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,363 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 15=

21
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:54,120
Miss Song,

22
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:55,840
I advise you not to act rashly.

23
00:01:58,439 --> 00:01:59,239
As an opera singer,

24
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:00,159
I'm not good with guns.

25
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,680
It could easily go off.

26
00:02:29,479 --> 00:02:30,280
Are you alright?

27
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,879
Take her to the Governor Mansion.

28
00:02:36,879 --> 00:02:38,000
- Yes.
- Yes.

29
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,360
You were too reckless today.

30
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:54,639
You nearly died.

31
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:57,520
Were you foolish or brave?

32
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:01,360
I owe you for this.

33
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,599
I'll definitely repay it.

34
00:03:11,136 --> 00:03:12,640
(Governor Mansion)

35
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,759
(Execute the Father-Killer)

36
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:15,479
Governor Mansion colludes
with a merchant,

37
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,639
protecting a father-killer

38
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:17,960
and utterly ignoring the people!

39
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:19,400
Hand over Jiang Chun'er now!

40
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,199
Execute Jiang Chun'er!

41
00:03:20,199 --> 00:03:21,360
Execute Jiang Chun'er!

42
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,680
Execute Jiang Chun'er!

43
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,039
Execute Jiang Chun'er!

44
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,639
Execute Jiang Chun'er!

45
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,680
The President Jiang's murder case
is still ongoing.

46
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,719
Besides, this is the Governor Mansion.

47
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,479
How dare you run wild here!

48
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:35,960
Is there no law in Fengcheng?

49
00:03:36,159 --> 00:03:37,360
To rise to power, Xu You'an

50
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,400
bribed an opera singer

51
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,520
to murder his foster father
on his wedding day.

52
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,520
It's heinous!

53
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:44,360
He is a demon with blood on his hands.

54
00:03:44,719 --> 00:03:46,560
Now he's shielding Jiang Chun'er

55
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,639
and colluding with her.

56
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:50,080
He's pushing us common people
to the brink of despair!

57
00:03:50,159 --> 00:03:50,960
Exactly!

58
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,319
Execute Jiang Chun'er!

59
00:03:52,319 --> 00:03:53,400
Execute Jiang Chun'er!

60
00:03:54,039 --> 00:03:56,039
Execute Jiang Chun'er!

61
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:58,520
Come out! Come out!

62
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,599
Daring to cause trouble
in front of Governor Mansion?

63
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,199
Do you all have a death wish?

64
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,439
Fellow townsfolk,

65
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:06,840
we must get an answer today!

66
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:11,080
Otherwise, he'll have us all dead
and our houses torn apart by tomorrow!

67
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:13,479
He's the son of a dancing girl!

68
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:18,240
Isn't a dancing girl just a prostitute?

69
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,279
Can a prostitute bear a decent child?

70
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:25,480
I advise you not to let others use you.

71
00:04:25,839 --> 00:04:28,439
The murderer in President Jiang's case
is someone else.

72
00:04:29,879 --> 00:04:32,600
You are the disciple
of the serial killer, Zhao Shengge.

73
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,160
You are both devils
persecuting us common people!

74
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:38,319
Fellow townsfolk, neither of them
is anything good!

75
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:39,920
Stone him to death!

76
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,759
Stone them to death!

77
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:42,839
Stone them to death!

78
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,480
Not good ones!

79
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,079
Neither of them are good!

80
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,879
Brat of a prostitute!

81
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,839
Stone them to death!

82
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:54,319
Xu You'an, it seems
they're coming for you.

83
00:04:54,759 --> 00:04:55,480
Don't act rashly.

84
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,399
Don't run!

85
00:04:58,839 --> 00:04:59,839
Not good ones!

86
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:00,800
Scoundrel!

87
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,800
Beat him to death!

88
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,600
Don't go!

89
00:05:06,759 --> 00:05:08,040
You're heartless!

90
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,439
Come back here!

91
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:12,256
(Governor Mansion)

92
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:21,399
Why look into the Xu family
and the Rongqing Troupe?

93
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:26,879
Because

94
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:30,160
I'm too infatuated with you.

95
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:32,720
You're engaged to the Miss Jiang.

96
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,759
If I wanted to be your wife,

97
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:42,240
I'd have to dig up everything
I could on my love rival.

98
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:46,040
Cut the crap.

99
00:05:46,519 --> 00:05:48,040
I don't buy that.

100
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,000
If you don't tell the truth,

101
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,319
our torture methods here

102
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:56,639
are not something
a fragile woman like you can bear.

103
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:02,639
Governor,

104
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:05,920
this is what we found
at Song Mianxiang's residence.

105
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:19,879
Announce to the public now
that Song Mianxiang is the real killer.

106
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:24,439
And tell everyone the execution
will be at noon tomorrow.

107
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,279
Yes.

108
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:30,600
Right. The one leading the mob
has already confessed.

109
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,920
The Xiaosheng Society's Du Xiaolin
instigated them.

110
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:35,040
(Him again.)

111
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,079
(After the matter of Chun'er is settled,)

112
00:06:38,639 --> 00:06:41,120
(the first thing I'll eliminate
is the Xiaosheng Society.)

113
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:58,480
Replace all the ammunition
for tomorrow's execution with blanks.

114
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,600
Alright.

115
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,040
You intend to let Song Mianxiang off?

116
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:16,639
She killed Jiang Xiaoren.
That's like avenging my mother.

117
00:07:18,079 --> 00:07:18,920
Besides,

118
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,360
she's not at fault.

119
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:28,040
So you're such a righteous
and understanding man.

120
00:07:30,319 --> 00:07:31,959
Poor me, misunderstood
by you for so long,

121
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:34,920
I never even got an apology.

122
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:51,759
You kept calling me "lackey" before,

123
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:54,000
so let's call it even.

124
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:03,879
Drink some water.

125
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:15,680
No.

126
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:17,000
No.

127
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,360
I want to go with Mother.

128
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:19,639
Mother.

129
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:21,839
Mother.

130
00:08:36,879 --> 00:08:40,960
Nowadays, many high officials and nobles
like opera singers like you.

131
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,919
Teach them to sing opera.

132
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:47,440
Otherwise, I'll kill them all.

133
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:48,320
I won't do that.

134
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,919
You're utterly devoid of conscience.

135
00:08:52,399 --> 00:08:54,000
You used me to curry favor.

136
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:58,200
I will absolutely not join you
in harming those innocent girls.

137
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:17,960
What are you doing?

138
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,879
No!

139
00:09:29,879 --> 00:09:30,639
No!

140
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,039
No!

141
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:35,879
I'll teach them.

142
00:09:40,279 --> 00:09:41,080
I'll teach them.

143
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:45,679
I'll teach them.

144
00:09:52,679 --> 00:09:56,360
So, that girl from eight years ago
was Song Mianxiang.

145
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:02,120
This way!

146
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:02,620
Hurry!

147
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:34,919
Here she is.

148
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:37,320
You dare to run?

149
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,039
You're dead, you brat!

150
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:39,659
Move!

151
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:40,980
Get up!

152
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,519
Let me go!

153
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:52,600
Move!

154
00:11:11,519 --> 00:11:16,159
I didn't expect you to visit
such a filthy place, Miss Jiang.

155
00:11:21,519 --> 00:11:22,320
I'm sorry.

156
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:27,200
If I hadn't let them find you back then,

157
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,720
you could've escaped
the Jiang residence.

158
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,519
You recognized me?

159
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:37,120
Since you recognized me,
how dare you come alone?

160
00:11:37,559 --> 00:11:39,200
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you?

161
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,039
I came to apologize to you.

162
00:11:45,519 --> 00:11:47,320
As expected, a naive young lady.

163
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:49,480
What do I need your apology for?

164
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,879
If it weren't for you back then,

165
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:54,360
I would've escaped that den of devils.

166
00:11:55,879 --> 00:11:59,519
After I was caught,
I nearly got beaten to death.

167
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,039
I'm sorry.

168
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:04,759
I'm sorry.

169
00:12:05,679 --> 00:12:06,960
I owe it all to you.

170
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:09,440
I will definitely compensate you.

171
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,039
Compensate?

172
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:16,600
This case must have a killer.

173
00:12:19,279 --> 00:12:20,639
Can you die in my place?

174
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,639
I can.

175
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,120
You're crazy.

176
00:12:29,559 --> 00:12:31,240
It was me who wronged you.

177
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:32,919
It was my family who wronged you.

178
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,679
This is the only thing I can do.

179
00:12:39,039 --> 00:12:39,960
Take this.

180
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:46,919
Put on my clothes.

181
00:12:47,039 --> 00:12:48,039
Leave Fengcheng.

182
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:50,039
Go to a place where no one knows you.

183
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:52,240
And live the life you deserve.

184
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,120
You want to die?

185
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,960
I'll grant your wish.

186
00:13:28,191 --> 00:13:29,471
♪As if it were fate♪

187
00:13:29,471 --> 00:13:30,828
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

188
00:13:31,390 --> 00:13:34,627
♪We miss each other♪

189
00:13:35,871 --> 00:13:37,439
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

190
00:13:37,439 --> 00:13:39,839
♪And a bizarre♪

191
00:13:39,839 --> 00:13:42,641
♪Anonymous legend♪

192
00:13:43,171 --> 00:13:45,183
♪The plot twists and turns♪

193
00:13:45,331 --> 00:13:47,071
♪Play out over and over again♪

194
00:13:47,071 --> 00:13:50,135
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

195
00:13:50,716 --> 00:13:52,415
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

196
00:13:52,415 --> 00:13:53,407
♪Refuse to submit♪

197
00:13:53,407 --> 00:13:56,607
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

198
00:13:58,271 --> 00:14:01,183
♪There are always too many♪

199
00:14:01,183 --> 00:14:03,071
♪Helpless situations♪

200
00:14:03,071 --> 00:14:05,695
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

201
00:14:06,826 --> 00:14:08,786
♪Even if I have questions♪

202
00:14:08,786 --> 00:14:10,786
♪I harbor desires♪

203
00:14:10,786 --> 00:14:13,663
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

204
00:14:14,014 --> 00:14:15,647
♪People come and go♪

205
00:14:15,647 --> 00:14:18,463
♪I'm still all alone♪

206
00:14:18,463 --> 00:14:21,191
♪Wandering around♪

207
00:14:21,439 --> 00:14:24,292
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

208
00:14:24,292 --> 00:14:28,753
♪Go through the entanglement♪

209
00:14:29,119 --> 00:14:30,847
♪If longing♪

210
00:14:30,847 --> 00:14:34,006
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

211
00:14:34,006 --> 00:14:36,761
♪How can I be at ease♪

212
00:14:36,863 --> 00:14:39,177
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

213
00:14:39,295 --> 00:14:41,151
♪And travelled around the world♪

214
00:14:41,247 --> 00:14:44,335
♪Scars all over me♪

215
00:14:44,607 --> 00:14:47,519
♪If longing never fades♪

216
00:14:47,519 --> 00:14:48,968
♪Burns still hot♪

217
00:14:48,968 --> 00:14:52,047
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

218
00:14:52,319 --> 00:14:54,176
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

219
00:14:54,239 --> 00:14:55,423
♪In the next life♪

220
00:14:55,423 --> 00:14:59,903
♪Entangle with you again♪
